#: ../../source/paperclip_SKILL.md:179
msgid ""
"Generic document: `/<prefix>/issues/<issue-identifier>#document"
"-<document-key>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/paperclip_SKILL.md:181
msgid ""
"If the issue identifier is available, prefer the document deep link over "
